# format_note : This header is parsed as YAML after all leading whitespace is stripped, so keep every entry on one line and avoid apostrophes
# name : LRIS-2 blue arm common path
# description : Throughput of the LRIS-2 blue arm optics that every mode passes through, except the dichroic
# author : BPH
# source : LRIS2_ETC data/throughput/LRIS2_blue_common_path.csv, copied here as code/LRIS2_blue_common_path.csv
# date_created : 2026-10-21
# date_modified : 2026-10-21
# status : design values from the PDR efficiency spreadsheets, via the LRIS-2 ETC
# type : instrument:transmission
# action : transmission
# wavelength_unit : um
# notes :
# - transmission = Window x COLL-M1 x COLL-M2 x FOLD x CAMERA from the source file.
# - The DICHROIC column is deliberately LEFT OUT. It is identical to TER_LRIS-2_dichroic.dat,
# - which is applied as its own effect, so including it here would count it twice.
# - Excludes the telescope mirrors (Keck.yaml), the ADC (LRIS-2.yaml), the grating and the CCD QE.
# - Data cover 0.310 to 0.570 um. Outside that, the end values are held flat to 0.30 and
# - 1.10 um. That is an EXTRAPOLATION so that every mode range is covered, not design data.
# - Reflection carries the lost light and emissivity is 0, so this adds no thermal emission.
# changes :
# - 2026-10-21 (BPH) created from LRIS2_blue_common_path.csv, nm to um, replacing the flat 0.70 camera placeholder
# - and the flat 0.999 collimator
#
